{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_66_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，不雨。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"不雨者，勤雨也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，不雨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"一時言不雨者，閔雨也。閔雨者，有志乎民者也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"三、徐人取舒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"四、六月，雨。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"雨云者，喜雨也。喜雨者，有志乎民者也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊侯、宋公、江人、黃人會於陽穀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"陽穀之會，桓公委端搢笏而朝諸侯。諸侯皆諭乎桓公之志。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"六、冬，公子季友如齊莅盟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"莅者位也。其不日，前定也。不言及者，以國與之也。不言其人，亦以國與之也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_66_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_66","textTraditional":"七、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}